--- /dev/null
+++ b/README_EXEC0169.md
@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+# EXEC0169 — native controller PRIVATE CHECKPOINT utility, not a completed game
+
+Continues complete EXEC0168 app. `OTHER` at original 14-command screen now opens an explicitly **PORT-ONLY** owner-private three-slot Save New / Cold Restore / Return screen. Confirm twice with A; B cancels; LB/RB selects slot. Both operations call existing hardened GK167 original-stock checkpoint I/O. No overwrite, source/Classic profile checks, original country RAM and order budget unchanged on cancel/rejection. Neither operation implements original NES Other, true seasonal generation, first Spring setup, original player actions, merchant RNG, AI, full campaign persistence, or console parity.
+
+Copyright-clean. Original stock RAM/checkpoint files remain user-private and never go on public GitHub. Linux integration and CTests required; Win32/physical controller not certified.
